WEBVTT


00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.500
Downloaded @ subs4free.club


00:09:12.500 --> 00:09:14.500
How did they manage to breach our systems?


00:09:16.000 --> 00:09:19.000
It could be a 'Rat' or other device.


00:09:20.000 --> 00:09:23.500
We must strengthen our defences.


00:09:24.000 --> 00:09:28.000
There may be more attacks like this.


00:09:30.000 --> 00:09:32.000
What were they after? access codes, passwords?


00:09:33.000 --> 00:09:35.000
- I don't think so.
Why not?


00:09:36.000 --> 00:09:40.000
They caused the reactor to overheat and explode!


00:09:42.000 --> 00:09:47.000
What then? Terrorism?
- No.


00:09:48.000 --> 00:09:51.000
Do they want money?


00:09:52.000 --> 00:09:54.000
No.


00:09:54.500 --> 00:09:57.000
Then what do they want? What's their motivation?


00:09:57.500 --> 00:09:59.000
I don't know yet.


00:09:59.100 --> 00:10:03.500
I'd like to contact the FBI's cyber-crimes branch for assistance.


00:10:04.000 --> 00:10:06.000
Then I can dig deeper.


00:10:06.500 --> 00:10:09.000
OK, Do what you have to do to to stop them!


00:10:09.500 --> 00:10:12.300
You're all clear to proceed.
- Thank you.

